      "content": "it's hard to see it any other way. it feels less like a defeat and more like just... choosing peace. if the world is only going to offer me this constant, heavy sadness, then leaving seems like the only way to actually be free of it. do you really think it's okay to just stop? to just decide that I've seen enough?",
